{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>PocketPacer Running 是一款專為跑者設計的配速與賽事規劃工具，適合希望在比賽前掌握目標配速、完成時間及每公里分段策略的人士。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-138.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>建立個人化賽事配速</h2>\n<p>它可為任何距離建立詳細賽事計劃，選擇平均、負分段或正分段配速，並調整策略進取程度；同時換算配速與速度、計算完成時間，加入能量補充安排，並把計劃整理成簡易 Garmin 手動設定。賽後亦可對照實際表現與原定計劃。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-50-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-51-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-52-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-53-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-54-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-55-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：PocketPacer Running</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/pocketpacer-running/id6817826074?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.389824+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":271,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T15:18:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T19:19:20.078716+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:14:06.216460+00:00","content_hash":"a38d9f145ed2b3ab2145375343ed344efba225ae873314c58ab282ee4fb5ee0a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.389824+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}